---
/**
 * Privacy Policy. City-level NAP only. No street. No lead form.
 */
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';

const seo = {
  title: 'Privacy Policy | Parcel Management Group',
  description:
    'How Parcel Management Group handles information on this website. No lead form and no SMS opt-in. Call (805) 984-4114 or use chat. Ventura, CA 93001.',
};
---
<Base title={seo.title} description={seo.description} canonical="/privacy/">
  <section class="page-hero" aria-label="Privacy Policy">
    <div class="wrap">
      <span class="eyebrow">Legal</span>
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="page-body">
    <div class="wrap prose">
      <p>Last updated September 22, 2026.</p>
      <p>Parcel Management Group (PMG) is a US freight broker in Ventura, CA 93001. This page explains what this website does with information, and how to ask a privacy question. Phone: <a href="tel:+18059844114">(805) 984-4114</a>.</p>

      <h2>Who we are</h2>
      <p>We arrange small package, less-than-truckload, and full truckload shipping for businesses. We are a registered freight broker: USDOT 3266041 · MC 1030328. We work from Ventura, CA 93001 and serve shippers nationwide.</p>

      <h2>What this website collects</h2>
      <p>This website does not have a form for your name, email, or phone number. It does not have an SMS opt-in. Nothing on these pages adds you to a text-message list.</p>
      <p>You can still reach us in two ways:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Call <a href="tel:+18059844114">(805) 984-4114</a>. We see the number your phone shows, and we use it to talk with you about your shipment.</li>
        <li>Start a chat with the chat button on the page.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Chat</h2>
      <p>The chat button is provided by LeadConnector. When you send a message, it comes to PMG so we can reply. You choose what to type. If you include an email address or a phone number, we use it to follow up on that conversation or quote.</p>
      <p>We keep chat messages so we can answer you and arrange freight. We do not sell personal information. We do not sell or buy customer lists. This site is not a marketplace for shipping inquiries.</p>

      <h2>Cookies</h2>
      <p>The chat tool may store a cookie so it can keep the conversation in your browser. We also load typefaces from Google Fonts. We do not run our own advertising cookies on this site.</p>
      <p>You can block cookies in your browser. If you do, the site still works. The chat may not remember the thread.</p>

      <h2>How we use information</h2>
      <p>We use what you share to answer questions, prepare quotes, book freight with carriers, and handle service issues. We do not use this website to collect phone numbers for a text-message program.</p>

      <h2>Who else sees it</h2>
      <p>We share shipment details with carriers and others who need them to move your freight. The company that hosts this website, and LeadConnector as the chat provider, process technical data so those tools can run. We do not sell your personal information to anyone.</p>

      <h2>Children</h2>
      <p>This site is for businesses. It is not directed at children.</p>

      <h2>Changes</h2>
      <p>We may update this page. When we do, we change the date at the top.</p>

      <h2>Privacy questions</h2>
      <p>Call <a href="tel:+18059844114">(805) 984-4114</a> or start a chat. Parcel Management Group, Ventura, CA 93001, USA.</p>
      <p>The rules for using the site are in our <a href="/terms/">Terms of Service</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
